index ac4d8ce..78ab7cc 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -11,9 +11,25 @@ Rates depend on the destination zone and the parcel weight.
 | Zone | Code |
 | --- | --- |
 | Domestic | `DOM` |
-| Europe | `EU` |
+| Europe | `EUR` |
 | Rest of the world | `WW` |
 
+`shippingRate(weight, zone)` takes either a weight in kg or a shipment `{ weightKg, lengthCm, widthCm, heightCm }`. A shipment is priced by its chargeable weight.
+
+### Chargeable weight
+
+`chargeableWeightKg(shipment)` returns the weight a shipment is billed by:
+
+1. The volumetric weight is `lengthCm × widthCm × heightCm / 5000`.
+2. The chargeable weight is the larger of the actual weight (`weightKg`) and the volumetric weight.
+3. It is rounded up to the next 0.5 kg. A value that is already a multiple of 0.5 kg stays as it is.
+
+If any dimension is missing, the actual weight is used, still rounded up to the next 0.5 kg.
+
+For example, a 0.8 kg parcel of 40 × 30 × 20 cm has a volumetric weight of 4.8 kg and a chargeable weight of 5 kg.
+
+`shipmentsToCsv(shipments)` exports the columns `id,zone,weightKg,chargeableWeightKg,rateCents` and prices each shipment by its chargeable weight.
+
 ## Delivery
 
 `estimateDelivery(orderedAt, transitDays)` returns the expected delivery date in Istanbul time.
